OL,3,ABrazil's left-wing President Lula wins
OL,4,Afourth term in surprise victory over
OL,5,AFlavio Bolsonaro
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrazil's left-wing President Lula wins
OL,8,Fa fourth term in office, defeating his
OL,9,Fright-wing challenger Flavio Bolsonaro
OL,10,F- here's how he did it
OL,12,FThe 80-year-old, who took just under
OL,13,F52% in the run-off vote, thanks
OL,14,Fcheering supporters in Sao Paulo who he
OL,15,Fsays "defended Brazilian democracy"
OL,17,FBolsonaro - who won the first round -
OL,18,Fsays the result is "inexplicable" and
OL,19,Fcalls for it to be annulled - our Latin
OL,20,FAmerica editor explains what's
OL,21,Fhappening
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
